		{
			dependencies: ["0C58D5FB226A6BC0"]
			description: [
				"&lFirst Tools&r"
				""
				"Punching down a tree is not where your story begins."
				""
				"Before wood becomes useful, you will need something sharp enough to work with. Start by finding &lGravel&r — it can be crafted into &lFlint&r, giving you the sharp edge needed for your first tools."
				""
				"With Flint in hand, use it on &lStone&r to break off loose &lRocks&r. These Rocks can then be shaped through &lKnapping&r into the components required for primitive tools."
				""
				"These early tools are crude and fragile, but they are enough to begin gathering the resources you need to survive."
				""
				"&lCraft Flint. Strike Stone for Rocks. Knapp the stone. Craft your first Primitive Tool.&r"
			]
			icon: "overgeared:knappable_rock"
			id: "52E066CDD1EF8C84"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "7585FB37ED9BF12F"
					item: "minecraft:flint"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 2L
