							Damage: 0
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "First Tools"
			x: -5.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["52E066CDD1EF8C84"]
			description: [
				"&lThe First Metal&r"
				""
				"Stone got you started. Metal will take you further."
				""
				"&lCopper&r is the first metal within your reach. Mine &lCopper Ore&r to obtain &lRaw Copper&r, then smelt it in a &lFurnace&r into usable &lCopper Ingots&r."
				""
				"This is your first step beyond primitive tools and into real metallurgy. Copper is soft, but it is workable — and it will become the foundation of your first forged tools."
				""
				"&lFind Copper. Smelt the Raw Copper. Prepare your first metal for the forge.&r"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:copper_ingot"
			id: "0A927C82CCCF6830"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "352ED06A7CFB46E4"
					item: "minecraft:raw_copper"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0E27B81B217F1DE9"
					item: "minecraft:copper_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "The First Metal"
			x: -5.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0A927C82CCCF6830"]
			description: [
				"&lTools of the Smith&r"
				""
				"Metal cannot be shaped with bare hands."
				""
				"Before you can build a proper place to work it, you will need a &lHammer&r. It is your first essential smithing tool, and you will need it to create your first &lStone Anvil&r."
				""
				"To make the Stone Anvil, place a block of &lSmooth Stone&r, then &lSneak + Right-Click&r it while holding your Hammer."
				""
				"Once the anvil is ready, craft a pair of &lSmithing Tongs&r so you can handle heated metal safely. Together, these form the basic tools of the forge."
				""
				"&lCraft a Hammer. Turn Smooth Stone into a Stone Anvil. Make Smithing Tongs. Prepare the forge.&r"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "overgeared:copper_smithing_hammer"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
