			title: "First Forging"
			x: -1.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0C58D5FB226A6BC0"]
			description: [
				"&lSurvive the First Night&r"
				""
				"You may build a shelter of your own or take refuge in a settlement you discover. How you survive is up to you — what matters is having a secure place to rest before darkness becomes a threat."
				""
				"Keep an eye on your &lHunger&r and &lStamina&r while you travel. Exhaustion can be just as dangerous as whatever waits outside your shelter."
				""
				"When you are safe, find or craft a &lBed&r and sleep through the night."
				""
				"&lFind shelter. Prepare a Bed. Sleep safely. Survive your first night.&r"
			]
			id: "7F568F5AB5DCDEFB"
			tasks: [{
				advancement: "minecraft:adventure/sleep_in_bed"
