		{
			dependencies: ["7F568F5AB5DCDEFB"]
			description: [
				"&lWarmth and Recovery&r"
				""
				"A fire can do more than hold back the dark."
				""
				"When you are wounded, a lit &lCampfire&r gives you a place to stop, rest, and recover before moving on."
				""
				"Staying near the flames allows you to regain your strength, making a Campfire more than just a source of light or warmth."
				""
				"Knowing when to rest is as important as knowing when to fight."
				""
				"&lLight a Campfire. Rest by the flames. Recover your strength.&r"
			]
