		{
			dependencies: ["0C58D5FB226A6BC0"]
			description: [
				"&lMore Than Hunger&r"
				""
				"Food does more than simply fill your hunger bar."
				""
				"Every food restores both &lHunger&r and &lSaturation&r. Hunger determines when you need to eat, while Saturation determines how long you can keep going before hunger begins to return."
				""
				"Simple foods may keep you alive, but they will not sustain you for long."
				""
				"Eating the same food repeatedly will also become less effective over time. A varied diet will keep you better fed and better prepared for longer journeys."
				""
				"&lEat well. Watch your Saturation. Vary your diet.&r"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:golden_carrot"
