			description: [
				"&lFoundation Established&r"
				""
				"You are no longer simply trying to survive."
				""
				"You have learned to make primitive tools, work your first metal, build a forge, find shelter, recover by the fire, and sustain yourself with more than whatever food happens to be nearby."
				""
				"These skills are only the beginning, but together they form the foundation every greater journey depends on."
				""
				"From here, survival becomes preparation — and preparation opens the way to exploration, stronger equipment, deeper craftsmanship, and greater challenges."
				""
				"&lYour foundation is established. The next stage of your journey is now open.&r"
			]
